# The data screens reached from the menus: the item list by ID, one item
# opened, the location list, and a text search from Ctrl-F.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
S ITEMLIST
K DOWN ENTER
S ITEM
K ESC ESC ALT-L
T B
S LOCLIST
K ESC CTRL-F
T Hercules
K ENTER
S FOUND
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
